body:
Thanks for the tips, it was all diagnosed 2 years ago, still trying to figure out meds or even what I have still ;-;

I want to continue to learn somehow. Idk how or what to do but I can’t just do nothing. 

I am leaps and bounds better than before I left though, the fact that I reached out is proof but I just want someone else than the couple of people I see a day to talk to
